    {
      "v": 3,
      "zh": "将城里的人拉出来，放在锯下，或铁耙下，或铁斧下（或译：强他们用锯，或用打粮食的铁器，或用铁斧做工），大卫待亚扪各城的居民都是如此。其后大卫和众军都回耶路撒冷去了。",
      "en": "He removed the city’s residents and made them labor with saws, iron picks, and axes.[NOTE:1] This was his policy[NOTE:2] with all the Ammonite cities. Then David and all the army returned to Jerusalem.",
      "notes": [
        "The Hebrew text reads “saws,” but since saws were just mentioned, it is preferable to emend מְגֵרוֹת (megerot, “saws”) to מַגְזְרוֹת (magzerot, “axes”).",
        "Heb “and so he would do.”"
      ],
