      "v": 4,
      "zh": "后来，以色列人在基色与非利士人打仗。户沙人西比该杀了伟人的一个儿子细派，非利士人就被制伏了。",
      "en": "Later there was a battle[NOTE:1] with the Philistines in Gezer.[NOTE:2] At that time Sibbekai the Hushathite killed Sippai,[NOTE:3] one of the descendants of the Rephaim, and the Philistines[NOTE:4] were subdued.",
      "notes": [
        "Heb “battle stood.”",
